<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3. </span>(Left) Comparison of the models in Directive-Type Match Accuracy (%). (Right) Comparison of the models in clause-wise Jaccard similarity.</figcaption>
</figure>
